{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "VR Sailing",
    "steam_appid": 3201570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you go out to sea today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a dream of sailing in their hearts, but due to geographical reasons, time constraints, economic reasons, and so on, it has been abandoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are bays suitable for sailing competitions from all over the world, come and enjoy the fun of sailing to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation of sailboats in the game is not so complicated. Just control the rudder with your left hand and the sail with your right hand to flexibly control the sailboat and enjoy the pleasure of riding the wind and waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can participate in sailing competitions along a fixed route, or embark on treasure hunting adventures at will. The wind direction is different every time, which can bring more fun and freshness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a013 real bay maps from around the world to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0You can choose between competition mode and treasure hunting mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are simple mode and expert mode to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are two operating habits to choose from: switching forward or reverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Each scene has 8 wind directions to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are 10 randomly occurring weather conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are 50 patterns and 5 colors of sails that can be purchased with points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Realistic ocean wave effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A fully physics based sailing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Each competition route will go through stages of downwind, headwind, and crosswind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0According to the 9 levels that have been upgraded based on the voyage, there are 9 levels waiting for you to challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Every game will match different opponents</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you go out to sea today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a dream of sailing in their hearts, but due to geographical reasons, time constraints, economic reasons, and so on, it has been abandoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are bays suitable for sailing competitions from all over the world, come and enjoy the fun of sailing to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation of sailboats in the game is not so complicated. Just control the rudder with your left hand and the sail with your right hand to flexibly control the sailboat and enjoy the pleasure of riding the wind and waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can participate in sailing competitions along a fixed route, or embark on treasure hunting adventures at will. The wind direction is different every time, which can bring more fun and freshness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a013 real bay maps from around the world to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0You can choose between competition mode and treasure hunting mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are simple mode and expert mode to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are two operating habits to choose from: switching forward or reverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Each scene has 8 wind directions to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are 10 randomly occurring weather conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0There are 50 patterns and 5 colors of sails that can be purchased with points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Realistic ocean wave effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A fully physics based sailing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Each competition route will go through stages of downwind, headwind, and crosswind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0According to the 9 levels that have been upgraded based on the voyage, there are 9 levels waiting for you to challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Every game will match different opponents</p>",
    "short_description": "It allows players to transform into sailboat navigators, sailing their beloved ships in the endless sea and enjoying the thrill of 360 degree immersive sailing and waves! Feel the forward momentum brought by the wind.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis is a very nice sailing simulator. I'm just starting with it, but it's quite immersive.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 pepehrsson<br><br>\u201cThis game is AMAZING for being in such early stages. I highly recommend this game.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Ghoul<br><br>\u201cIm weiten Meer, das ein kleines Boot f\u00e4hrt, wellt das Boot in den Wellen. Man muss immer wachsam sein und mit den Wellen tanzen. Jede Fluktuation ist eine Pr\u00fcfung des Mutes und der Ausdauer.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 fanshenry<br>",
